      "overlay": 0,
      "note": "The queued comparison crosses teaching\nmethod with code assistance on additional\ngoals and recipe settings. It uses\nexisting trained models.\n\nLater RL and recursive-helper studies are\nproposals, not results.\n\nInvite suggestions for another task with\ndependent steps and an objective success\ncheck. The candidate contribution is when\nthis division of work helps."
